      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 0.0,
      "text": "大家好,欢迎来到课代表立正的频道。"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 7.36,
      "id": "youtube-Ril9owWEHxg#cue-2",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "在我旁边的这位是今天的嘉宾Emily。"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 12.359,
      "id": "youtube-Ril9owWEHxg#cue-3",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "然后接下来我们请Emily姐姐做一下自我介绍。"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 14.72,
      "id": "youtube-Ril9owWEHxg#cue-4",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 12.359,
      "text": "Hello,大家好,我是Emily。"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 17.76,
      "id": "youtube-Ril9owWEHxg#cue-5",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 14.72,
      "text": "然后今年5月份刚从UC Berkeley本科毕业,"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 21.839,
      "id": "youtube-Ril9owWEHxg#cue-6",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 17.76,
      "text": "然后现在在耶鲁大学的MBA,第一年的MBA学生。"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 29.48,
      "id": "youtube-Ril9owWEHxg#cue-7",
      "speaker_id": "unknown",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "speaker_status": "unresolved",
      "start_seconds": 21.839,
      "text": "Emily姐姐就是在UC Berkeley上了三年的大学本科,"
